  "description": "Solve math problems on your feet or paused to think!\n\nArithmeticAddition, subtraction, multiplication, and division problems are coming for you. Beware the long forms.\n\nMinigamesNumber line, counting currency in various denominations, Venn diagram, hexadecimal conversion, and many more.\n\nGauntlet CustomizationMix up what kind of problems you want to face and at what difficulty level with a custom gauntlet of foes.\n\nGeography PuzzlesTake a break from the math with a jigsaw puzzle made of countries.\n\nBase CustomizationBreak your brain by changing the base to anywhere from 2 to 36.",
  "description_short": "Math has come to attack the peaceful city of Multiplicity! Solve arithmetic problems in this top-down 2D shooter mixed with a plethora of minigames. Practice math on your own terms; challenge yourself or relax with flexible difficulty settings.",
